    /// This property shall contain the user-assigned asset tag, which is an identifying string that tracks the equipment for inventory purposes.  Modifying this property may modify the `AssetTag` in the containing `Chassis` resource.
    AssetTag: core.Nullable([]const u8) = .absent,
    /// The location of the equipment.
    ///
    /// This property shall contain the location information of the associated equipment.
